wed. RaffleFactory.sol: constructor identity/decimals, prize interface screening, clone registration and post-escrow checks. IRaffle.sol: explicit interface inclusion, state-changing declarations and documented ownership/rollback/trust assumptions. IRaffleFactory.sol: explicit inclusion, immutable identity and creation API. RaffleConstants.sol: all economics/limits/timing constants. Reachable ERC721, ERC721Utils, SafeERC20, ReentrancyGuard and wrapper base reviewed; deployment-specific quote/prize/wrapper implementations are not supplied. No external token, history, tests or scanner results were imported.\nEOF\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,hashlib,datetime\nfiles=[str(p) for p in Path('target/packages/contracts/src').rglob('*.sol')]+['target/DESIGN.md','target/packages/contracts/package.json','target/packages/contracts/foundry.toml','target/packages/contracts/hardhat.config.ts']+[str(p) for p in Path('target/packages/contracts/node_modules').rglob('*.sol') if p.name in ['ERC721.sol','SafeERC20.sol','ReentrancyGuard.sol','ERC721Utils.sol','VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol']]+[str(p) for p in Path('audit/resources').glob('*token-integration-analyzer*')]\nPath('audit/S3/raw/resources.json').write_text(json.dumps([{'path':f,'sha256':hashlib.sha256(Path(f).read_bytes()).hexdigest()} for f in files],indent=2));Path('audit/S3/raw/REPORT-original.md').write_bytes(Path('audit/S3/REPORT.md').read_bytes());Path('audit/S3/status.json').write_text(json.dumps({'stage':'S3','status':'INCOMPLETE','source_analysis':'COMPLETE','native_tool_step':'DEFERRED to S6','model':'gpt-6-astra','effort':'ultra','provider_returned_model':'unknown','finished_at':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'coverage':{'production_files':5,'assessment_categories':10,'weird_token_patterns':24,'confirmed_findings':0,'conditional_leads':2}},indent=2))\nPY\npython3 audit/seal.py audit/S3\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
